{"Version": 2, "ProgramText": "; \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n;  VECTOR CUBES\n;\n;  The Amiga and Atari ST demo classic, now with textures: a big cube\n;  with an eye on every side turns and sways in the middle, and six\n;  small burning cubes go round it, now behind it and now in front.\n;  Copper bars and stars behind, a sine scroller in front.\n;\n;  Layer 0: copper bars and stars    Layer 1: the cubes (OBJECT)\n;  Layer 2: the sine scroller, its rainbow on the red of the font\n; \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\nSCREEN 640,480\nMUSIC PLAY \"Sound/Tracker/XM/Cube.XM\"\n\n; \u2500\u2500 Layer 0: a dark sky, two copper bars and stars \u2500\u2500\nSCREEN SELECT 0\nRASTER CLEAR\nRASTER 1, 0, 0, 480, \"#000008, #0C0628, #000008\"\nRASTER 2, 0, 0, 18, \"#100020, #C050FF, #100020\"\nRASTER 3, 0, 0, 18, \"#001020, #40C8FF, #001020\"\nPARTICLE 3, 14\n\n; \u2500\u2500 Layer 1: the cubes. The camera is at 0, 0, 0 and looks along z \u2500\u2500\nSCREEN SELECT 1\nOBJECT CUBE 1, 150\nOBJECT TEXTURE 1, \"Graphics/Textures/256_002.png\"\nNC = 6\nFOR I = 2 TO NC + 1\n  OBJECT CUBE I, 44\n  OBJECT TEXTURE I, \"Graphics/Textures/256_001.png\"\nNEXT I\nLIGHT -1, -1, -1.4, 25     ; from the top left, in front; 25% light on the dark sides\n\n; \u2500\u2500 Layer 2: the sine scroller \u2500\u2500\nSCREEN SELECT 2\nFONT LOAD 1, \"Graphics/font.png\", 32, 25\nFONT MAP 1, \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ!?:;0123456789@()\u00a3$%.\u2019[]\u201d,-\"\nFONT ZOOM 1, 200\nRASTER 1, 0, 360, 120, \"Yellow, Orange, Red, Magenta, Cyan, Yellow\"\nRASTER COLOUR 2, \"Red\"\n\nTXT$ = \"            VECTOR CUBES IN AMOS LIKE BASIC!   OBJECT CUBE, OBJECT TEXTURE AND OBJECT ROTATE\"\nTXT$ = TXT$ & \" IS ALL IT TAKES.   THE SMALL CUBES GO ROUND THE BIG ONE IN 3D, NOW BEHIND IT AND NOW IN FRONT.\"\nTXT$ = TXT$ & \"   MUSIC: CUBE.   WRAP!   \"\nCW = 64\nSX = 0 : T = 0\n\n; \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\nLoop:\n  T = T + 1\n\n  ; The big cube turns round all three axes and sways\n  CX = SIN(T * 0.7) * 70\n  CY = SIN(T * 1.1) * 25 - 30\n  OBJECT POS 1, CX, CY, 430\n  OBJECT ROTATE 1, T * 1.3, T * 0.9, T * 0.4\n\n  ; The small ones go round it on a tilted ring\n  FOR I = 2 TO NC + 1\n    A = T * 1.6 + (I - 2) * 60\n    OBJECT POS I, CX + COS(A) * 230, CY + SIN(A) * 60, 430 + SIN(A) * 230\n    OBJECT ROTATE I, T * 3, T * 2 + I * 20, 0\n  NEXT I\n\n  ; The copper bars swing\n  RASTER #0, MOVE 2, 229 + SIN(T * 1.7) * 210\n  RASTER #0, MOVE 3, 229 + SIN(T * 1.7 + 70) * 210\n\n  ; The sine scroller\n  SX = SX + 4\n  IF SX >= LEN(TXT$) * CW THEN SX = 0\n  C = INT(SX / CW)\n  FONT CLEAR\n  FOR K = 0 TO 11\n    X = K * CW - (SX MOD CW)\n    FONT PRINT #2, 1, X, 400 + SIN(X * 0.6 - T * 3) * 22, MID$(TXT$ & TXT$, C + 1 + K, 1)\n  NEXT K\n\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO Loop\n", "ScreenWidth": null, "ScreenHeight": null, "Sprites": null, "MapWidth": null, "MapHeight": null, "MapData": null}